<title>CANADA: Seagram Co Ltd Q2 net higher.</title>
<headline>Seagram Co Ltd Q2 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr			US$0.17		  US$0.16</p>
<p> Net			 62,000		   58,000</p>
<p> Revs		   2,493,000		1,433,000</p>
<p>	    5 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			US$0.23		  US$8.99</p>
<p> Net			 85,000		3,349,000</p>
<p> Revs		   5,013,000		2,715,000</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)  </p>
<p>Note: Results for two months (second quarter) and five months ending June 30 reflect the transition to a fiscal year end of June 30 from January 31.</p>
<p>Five-months results for 1995 include a gain on the DuPont Co share redemption. Before the gain, five months net for 1995 was US$117 million, or US$0.32 per share.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100</p>
</text>
